        "type": "input",
        "stem": "<p>If the number of tiles needed to cover one pavement in the street is <span class=\"no_margin merge\">1,206</span> tiles, how many tiles are needed to cover <span class=\"no_margin merge\">12</span> pavements of the same area?</p>",
