        },
        "explanation": "<p>Each pavement needs <span class=\"no_margin merge\">1‎ ‎206</span> tiles. 12 pavements of the same area need to be covered.</p><p>We can multiply to find how many tiles are needed in total: <svg width=\"113.73\" height=\"13.604\" viewBox=\"353.408 270.318 85.297 10.203\" class=\"displayed_equation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g font-family=\"NagwaMath\" font-size=\"13.5\"><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"352.564\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"361.454\">2</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"368.112\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"374.769\">6</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"384.413\">×</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"396.221\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"402.879\">2</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"436.127\">.</text></g><g font-family=\"STIX2\" font-size=\"13.5\"><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"412.698\">t</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"416.935\">i</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"420.768\">l</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"424.574\">e</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"430.815\">s</text></g></svg></p><p>There are many methods to multiply numbers. We will use the standard algorithm: <svg width=\"215.736\" height=\"134.031\" viewBox=\"315.327 260.93 161.802 100.524\" class=\"displayed_equation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M 0.00140625 -0.00121875 L 53.212344 -0.00121875\" transform=\"matrix(1,0,0,-1,326.315,307.073)\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\".398\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" /><path d=\"M 0.00140625 0.000125 L 53.212344 0.000125\" transform=\"matrix(1,0,0,-1,326.315,347.422)\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\".398\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" /><g font-family=\"NagwaMath\" font-size=\"13.5\"><text y=\"280.647\" x=\"338.951\">1</text><text y=\"280.647\" x=\"349.59\">2</text><text y=\"280.647\" x=\"360.236\">0</text><text y=\"280.647\" x=\"370.878\">6</text><text y=\"300.821\" x=\"315.076\">×</text><text y=\"300.821\" x=\"360.226\">1</text><text y=\"300.821\" x=\"370.878\">2</text><text y=\"320.996\" x=\"338.951\">2</text><text y=\"320.996\" x=\"349.59\">4</text><text y=\"320.996\" x=\"360.228\">1</text><text y=\"320.996\" x=\"370.867\">2</text><text y=\"341.17\" x=\"314.639\">+</text><text y=\"341.17\" x=\"328.304\">1</text><text y=\"341.17\" x=\"338.942\">2</text><text y=\"341.17\" x=\"349.581\">0</text><text y=\"341.17\" x=\"360.233\">6</text><text y=\"341.17\" x=\"370.872\">0</text><text y=\"361.344\" x=\"328.308\">1</text><text y=\"361.344\" x=\"338.947\">4</text><text y=\"361.344\" x=\"349.585\">4</text><text y=\"361.344\" x=\"360.224\">7</text><text y=\"361.344\" x=\"370.876\">2</text><text y=\"321.37\" x=\"394.97\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">⟵</text><text y=\"321.37\" x=\"420.376\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">1</text><text y=\"321.37\" x=\"429.28\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">2</text><text y=\"321.37\" x=\"435.937\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">0</text><text y=\"321.37\" x=\"442.595\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">6</text><text y=\"321.37\" x=\"452.238\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">×</text><text y=\"321.37\" x=\"464.033\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">2</text><text y=\"341.544\" x=\"394.97\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">⟵</text><text y=\"341.544\" x=\"420.376\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">1</text><text y=\"341.544\" x=\"429.28\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">2</text><text y=\"341.544\" x=\"435.937\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">0</text><text y=\"341.544\" x=\"442.595\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">6</text><text y=\"341.544\" x=\"452.238\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">×</text><text y=\"341.544\" x=\"464.033\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">1</text><text y=\"341.544\" x=\"470.691\" fill=\"#55a4e0\">0</text></g><g font-family=\"NagwaMath\" font-size=\"9.467\"><text y=\"267.586\" x=\"360.895\" fill=\"#e14b3b\"></text></g></svg></p><p>Therefore, <svg width=\"148.518\" height=\"12.542\" viewBox=\"340.361 271.115 111.389 9.406\" class=\"displayed_equation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g font-family=\"NagwaMath\" font-size=\"13.5\"><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"339.517\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"348.407\">2</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"355.065\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"361.722\">6</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"371.366\">×</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"383.174\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"389.832\">2</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"400.215\">=</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"413.638\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"420.295\">4</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"429.199\">4</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"435.856\">7</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"442.514\">2</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"449.171\">.</text></g></svg></p>"
